Status: BLOCKED

Method: Structural dissection / interaction

Scope / coordinates: Registered g3: Ih factor 37.5 plus leak x1.5 on B3, SP3.

Remaining search space: The combined intervention meets all registered bands or misses at least one; no observation selects an outcome.

Binary predicate: An actual g3 evaluation satisfies every registered gain/preservation band.

Decision limit: SP3 stage-G registered bands; additive predictions are not measurements.

Recorded observation: g3 was registered but not run. SP3 closed FAIL at 3 of 4; the additive prediction missed the bands.

YES: An interaction warrants further independent testing.

NO: This combined intervention fails under the tested conditions.

Next check: No automatic resumption. A new bounded reassessment must distinguish interaction, voltage/use-dependent current, and alternative-donor explanations.

Unresolved after either answer: Slow Na inactivation, Kv7/M, other mechanisms, interactions and reference-family differences remain hypotheses, not an exhaustive list.

